M55 Entry Report Product Law (SSOT v1)

1. Product Identity

Name: Entry Report

Price: ¥1,000 (tax incl.)

Core Value: From "outline" (Free) to "structured meaning and usage" (Paid)

2. 8-Chapter Structure

あなたという人物 (Conclusion)

構成と傾向の全体像 (Structure)

強みが自然に出る場面 (Strengths)

つまずきやすい偏り (Bottlenecks)

本質と安定の条件 (Stability)

役割・仕事との噛み合わせ (Roles)

今の焦点と整え方 (Current Focus)

これからの使い方 (Practical Usage)

3. 5-Axis Analytical Framework (C/E/S/D/L)

C: Create (創造・成長)

E: Express (表現・情熱)

S: Support (共鳴・育成)

D: Decide (判断・洗練)

L: Logic (知性・流動)

4. AI Chat / Add-on Rule

Location: Inside purchaser-only rooms only.

Price: ¥700 (tax incl.) per round.

Max Rounds: Total 3 (1 free with report + 2 add-ons).

Tone: Analytical, high-density (approx. 1,800 characters), including data tables.


